The people had a serious "learning to do new things"
problem.  I had a huge knockdown-drag out because
one of those guys refused to use GALAXY; he was still
using MPB and shipping MBP as the batch software on
all customer systems.  Field service needed software
installed on the KLAD that customers would run.  Refurb
people fought that tooth and nail.  

I still remember that fight clearly.  I could not get
them to understand why the KLAD had to have the 7-series
monitor nor why field service had to have 7.01 and later
software on the KLADs.

